SUMMARY:The Moon occults Venus (disappearance only)
DESCRIPTION:Venus disappears at 20:35:33 CST\, seen from Liupanshui\, CN.\n
 The Moon sets during the occultation: only the disappearance is above the 
 horizon.\nThe Moon is 2° up in the WSW · dark sky.\nTimes for the Moon's
  mean limb\, ±2 s.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moon's edge: https:
 //occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=26.5944&lon=104.8333
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=26.5944&lon=104.8333
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
